        }
        /// Whether `name`, a parameter of the function being compiled, is what the closures around
        /// it captured for a local `var`, shared or not, through no explicit capture list
        /// (RFC-0085, I5): a task body, an arm, a reaction body, a `Batch{}` body or a landing
        /// that assigns it shares it (S1d), as an `Fn` does.
        fn capturesVar(self: *const Self, name: []const u8) bool {
            const w = self.workspace;
